      "helperText": "This field should only be filled in if there is more than 1 cause.\nTechnician Error - Improper or Failed Previous Repair\nAsset Design Defect - Poor design caused failure\nComponent Manufacturing Defect - Part was incorrectly manufactured\nPreventative Maintenance Quality - PM was not performed as prescribed or with low quality\nPreventative Maintenance Gap - PM routine is insufficient\nElectrical/Power Failure - NOT Communication or Code Failure\nOperational Process Failure - Driven By Process Mistake\nOperator Failure - Driven By Operator/Driver Mistake\nCollision/Impact - Asset struck another object or vice versa\nDriver/Operator Abuse - Driver caused damaged (non-collison)"
